%%body
{
  Your head pounded like a thousand drums had been struck inside it.

  You could see vague visages of people around you, but a single blink wiped them out once more.

  Blinking a few times, you could vaguely recall something, but once it was on the cusp of your mind: it vanished once more.

  Still, you recalled... training, with some soldiers, your fellow men.

  Clearing your mind and eyes, you notice the distant yet familiar training course, the peacekeeper's voice ring in your head still, you sigh and move forward.

    @ Voice "Let's see if you greenhorns know how to move, walk to the other side of the room, or run, I don't care."

  Seeing as you could barely control your body, you stumbled along to the designated area.
}
%date 2026-08-12
